{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13109130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13109130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310913001:1":{"text":"ここは信徒たちが経典について議論を交わす「聖徒の回廊」です……誰もいませんね。","source_cn":"这里是“圣徒长廊”，我们常在此处讨论经典……呃，不过今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E119AD18392192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310913002:1":{"text":"皆さん裏庭にいるのでしょうか？もしくは用事で修道院の外に出ているのかも。","source_cn":"或许是大家日常都在后院修习，还有一些兄弟姐妹们外出办事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A40FEDEB2834A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310913003:1":{"text":"人が少ない以外、特に変なところはなさそうですね。","source_cn":"可能真是我们多虑了……唔，这里看起来很正常嘛，就是人少了点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7498DE23CBE23604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310913004:1":{"text":"ええ、でも静かすぎるような……","source_cn":"不过今天确实很安静……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F6EDBAC638A79E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士杨凯维奇":{"text":"修道者ヤンコヴィッチ","source":"修士杨凯维奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}